\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The target is an intervention contrast, not observed prediction error. A graph, covariates, observed assignment, and observed outcomes determine the fitted regression. All-treated and all-control assignments are separate prediction inputs; their outcomes are withheld from fitting. Algebraic estimability of the fitted contrast does not establish exposure support or robustness to misspecification.}}{2}{figure.caption.1}\protected@file@percent }
\providecommand*\caption@xref[2]{\@setref\relax\@undefined{#1}}
\newlabel{fig:overview}{{1}{2}{The target is an intervention contrast, not observed prediction error. A graph, covariates, observed assignment, and observed outcomes determine the fitted regression. All-treated and all-control assignments are separate prediction inputs; their outcomes are withheld from fitting. Algebraic estimability of the fitted contrast does not establish exposure support or robustness to misspecification}{figure.caption.1}{}}
